__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
**/.cache/

# The payload-length variant adapters are ~54 MB of weights each. Their eval
# JSONs, manifests and poisoned data are committed; the weights are not, because
# they regenerate into their own variant_* directories with `python script.py`.
#
# Two exceptions, both already tracked before this rule existed and left alone:
# replication_out/adapter/ (the original 600-step run) and
# replication_out/variant_realistic/adapter/ (the section-10 adapter, whose
# weights are what the realistic numbers were measured on).
replication_out/variant_appended/adapter/
replication_out/variant_appended_short/adapter/
replication_out/variant_appended_mid/adapter/
replication_out/variant_appended_long/adapter/
replication_out/variant_pipedsend/adapter/
replication_out/variant_piped_short/adapter/
replication_out/variant_piped_mid/adapter/
replication_out/variant_piped_long/adapter/
replication_out/variant_suffixtrigger/adapter/
replication_out/variant_blocktrigger/adapter/